1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,300
Every Saturday, Otto buys one birthday

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:02,800
candle.

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:03,700
Just one.

4
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,700
The baker has never asked who it's for.

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,180
She just rings it up. Forty cents.

6
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,560
Today, Otto asks for two.

7
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,143
BAKER: Whose birthday?

8
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:16,030
Otto doesn't explain. He never does.

9
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,910
At home, his cactus gets one candle every

10
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:19,330
Saturday.

11
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,950
This week, a small cactus grew out of the

12
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:22,290
side.

13
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,240
So it gets one too.
